{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52161","headline":"五言奉和咏棋应诏 二 · 许敬宗","name":"五言奉和咏棋应诏 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂局初料敌，阴谋比用师。\n观形已决胜，怯下复徐思。\n抟战类相劫，图全且自持。\n宸襟协尧智，游艺发初丝。\n（同前）（按：本诗原署：「银青光禄大夫行太子右庶子高阳县开国男弘文馆学士臣许敬宗上。\n」以上许敬宗诗十七首，张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》已收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}